# What the Vercel CLI must never upload when deploying from the repo root.
# (Git-triggered builds use GitHub, where none of these exist.)

# Secrets and local notes
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local.md

# Not needed by any Vercel project
mobile/
evidence/
docs/
payment-providers-teardown.md
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/tests/
**/.dart_tool/
